<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 4.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 4.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on October 3.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		    Yield     Close</p>
<p>1  McIntosh Sec	    10.47     0.86</p>
<p>2  Prime Credit Tr	 10.21     0.96</p>
<p>3  Prop Income Inv	 10.06     1.01</p>
<p>4  Indu Property	    9.89     1.12</p>
<p>5  Villa World		9.82     0.92</p>
<p>6  BT Prop Trust	    9.38     1.74</p>
<p>7  Colonial Mutual	  9.28     1.14</p>
<p>8  Centro Prop		8.94     1.02</p>
<p>9  Central Equity	   8.82     2.18</p>
<p>10 Aust Tour		  8.82     0.85</p>
<p>11 Gandel Retail Tr	 8.76     0.78</p>
<p>12 Equitilink		 8.62     0.89</p>
<p>13 Nth Building Soc	 8.46     0.58</p>
<p>14 Barclays Mirvac	  8.46     1.30</p>
<p>15 Armstrong Retail	 8.46     2.72</p>
